WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.448
Counting choices that obey two rulebooks.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.632
Many objects are choices allowed by two rulebooks

3
00:00:05.632 --> 00:00:07.935
at once, like matchings and spanning trees.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.186
Imperfect picks are weighted, then the weight

5
00:00:11.186 --> 00:00:13.060
is lowered, sampling at each stage.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.912
Claimed: fast approximate counting.

7
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.784
Lean checks only part.
